WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Mama's porch swing creaking and the light's still on

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.780
Maybe it was moonshine, maybe it was dreams

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:14.640
Maybe this old world's bigger than it seems

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:21.800
But I followed that glow all the way back home

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:28.000
To sweet tea at sunrise and the porch light on
